              "value": 17
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You can call forth a blasphemous word from the fiendish realms to punish your foes. Once per day, you can cast divine decree as a 7th-level divine innate spell. You must choose evil for the spell, and you can Cast the Spell regardless of whether you have a deity or what their alignment is."
            }
          }
